OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle blaze at
OL,4,Ahistorical Grade II listed pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters were called to a blaze at
OL,7,Fa derelict pub on Wednesday evening.
OL,9,FCrew from Essex County Fire and Rescue
OL,10,Fservice were called to the Grade II
OL,11,Flisted The Worlds End Pub in Tilbury,
OL,12,FThurrock at 15:30 BST.
OL,14,FThe fire was under control by 18:30 but
OL,15,Ffirefighters remained at the scene on
OL,16,FFrot Road throughout the evening to
OL,17,Fcheck for hot spots to make sure the
OL,18,Farea was safe.
OL,20,FOfficers said they are set to carry out
OL,21,Fan investigation into the cause of the
OL,22,Fblaze when it is safe to do so.
